    "description": {
      "type": "/type/text",
      "value": "A study of John and Horace Dodge, the Dodge Brothers, and their automobile company, chronicling their lives -- from their childhood in Niles, Michigan, to their years of learning the machinist's trade in Battle Creek, and other cities -- and examining their influence on automotive manufacturing and marketing trends in the early part of the 20th century."
